<title>JAPAN: Kyowa Exeo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kyowa Exeo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>		     six months		   previous six months</p>
<p> Sales		 81.83		vs	   99.51</p>
<p> Operating	    3.35		vs	    4.28</p>
<p> Current		3.04		vs	    4.11</p>
<p> Net		    1.62		vs	    1.56</p>
<p> EPS		   15.19 yen	  vs	   14.58 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    107 million	  vs	 107 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  0.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kyowa Exeo Corp is a general telecommunications</p>
<p>engineering firm. The comparison figures were for the six</p>
<p>month period ended on March 31, 1996, because the company</p>
<p>changed its business term.</p>
